<!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml><![endif]--><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><strong>粗体段落</strong><span lang="EN-US">x</span></p><table><tbody><tr class="firstRow"><td class="MsoNormal">单元格<!--[if !mso]><span>条件注释</span><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">English run</span>与中文混排</p><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="MsoHyperlink"><a href="http://example.com">链接</a></span></p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;首行缩进用不间断空格表达</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center"><strong><em>居中粗斜体</em></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:blue;mso-highlight:yellow">彩色文本</span></p><p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">列表项<span lang="EN-US">1</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">遗留 font 标签</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt">字号 run</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><!--[if !mso]><style>.sdcolor {color:green}</style><![endif]--><p class="MsoNormal">段落<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;</span>间距</p><p class="MsoNormal">末尾中文。<span lang="EN-US">.</span></p>